WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.590
You know, with everything
happening in the world,

00:00:01.590 --> 00:00:04.030
many experts are saying
people should not plan

00:00:04.030 --> 00:00:06.690
to have a traditional
Thanksgiving celebration.

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:09.760
Well just today, there was
yet another press conference

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:11.520
from a concerned group.

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:14.380
We have some of the footage
of that press conference.

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:15.446
Have a look.

00:00:15.446 --> 00:00:16.279
(crowd chattering)

00:00:16.279 --> 00:00:19.460
(microphone feedback)

00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:21.130
Thank you all for gathering here today.

00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:22.650
Let's keep this quick.

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:24.760
Today I speak for all turkeys.

00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:27.280
When I say it would be
highly inappropriate

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:31.330
to move forward with any
normal Thanksgiving traditions

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:34.710
until President Trump
has officially conceded

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:37.040
the presidential race.

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:39.490
Also no turkeys should be eaten

00:00:39.490 --> 00:00:42.860
until everyone has
received a COVID vaccine

00:00:42.860 --> 00:00:45.750
that is 100% effective.

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:47.810
It just makes sense, people.

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:50.539
And some are saying that
six out of eight turkeys

00:00:50.539 --> 00:00:54.480
have contracted the death wing virus.

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:56.240
So thanks for coming out.

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.743
All right, let's hit that dildo store.

